      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "919C6BF04B41CC5E",
      "text": "Ne vous en faites pas pour ça.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "919C6AF04B41CAAB",
      "text": "De quoi voulez-vous parler ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_05a",
      "hash64": "E37843F6C3EA3C6E",
      "text": "Ha ha... Merci, votre maturité vous honore.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_05b",
      "hash64": "E37842F6C3EA3ABB",
      "text": "De la fois où j’ai dû soudainement prendre congé\\nalors que nous étions en train de bavarder.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_06",
      "hash64": "FD55945EBA6B106E",
      "text": "La Dracologue que vous avez pu voir était\\nen réalité un membre de ma famille.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_08",
      "hash64": "FD558E5EBA6B063C",
      "text": "Voyez-vous, je viens d’une longue lignée\\nde Dresseurs spécialisés en Pokémon Dragon.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_09",
      "hash64": "FD558F5EBA6B07EF",
      "text": "Dès mon plus jeune âge, j’ai reçu une éducation\\nvisant à me préparer à prendre la tête de\\r\\nla famille, une fois le moment venu.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_10",
      "hash64": "FD591C5EBA6E2D5D",
      "text": "Seulement, lorsque j’étais encore un jeune\\nhomme, je me suis opposé à ce destin tout tracé.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_11",
      "hash64": "FD591B5EBA6E2BAA",
      "text": "Du jour au lendemain, j’ai décidé de quitter\\nla maison et de vivre de ma musique ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_12",
      "hash64": "FD591A5EBA6E29F7",
      "text": "Beaucoup d’eau a coulé sous les ponts depuis...\\nEt les hasards de la vie m’ont amené à devenir\\r\\nenseignant, puis membre du Conseil 4.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_13",
      "hash64": "FD59195EBA6E2844",
      "text": "La personne que vous avez vue la dernière fois\\nm’a instamment demandé de quitter mon poste\\r\\nde professeur afin de succéder à mon père.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_14",
      "hash64": "FD59185EBA6E2691",
      "text": "On m’a expliqué que sa santé était\\nun peu déclinante...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_15",
      "hash64": "FD59175EBA6E24DE",
      "text": "Mais je m’égare, pardonnez-moi...\\c\\nCe n’est pas digne d’un enseignant que de\\nse lamenter de la sorte devant des étudiants.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_03",
      "hash64": "919C69F04B41C8F8",
      "text": "Mais non, vous êtes un excellent professeur !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_04",
      "hash64": "919C70F04B41D4DD",
      "text": "S’il vous plaît, ne quittez pas l’académie !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_16",
      "hash64": "FD59165EBA6E232B",
      "text": "M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0707)]on chera chère [VAR 0x0100(0000)]... Vous n’imaginez pas\\nce que ces mots signifient pour moi.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
